[{"client_msg_id":"ecd35f82-432b-4740-989d-60b6becb9fcd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ubuntu だと logrotate の nginx はデフォルト 10 なんですよね。","ts":"1614658724.065800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b/1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb2a60ea-82cd-4441-811f-253acda027f4","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"とりあえず設定変更しなおしたけど、ちゃんときいてるかどうかを監視するのは面倒そう。","ts":"1614654688.065400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x8p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1404fcb-0a03-4504-b055-2b9baf91f6f4","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"つまり ubuntu の apache2 の logrotate のデフォルトは2週間ぐらい。","ts":"1614654477.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9fMi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8275ba7d-dfe9-4e55-a03f-fb624f3a3cbb","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"etckeeper のログで確認したら logrotate.d/apache2 は weekly で rotate 52 に変更してたのが、 daily で rotate 14 に戻っていた…。1月って数年前のだったっぽい…。","ts":"1614654428.064400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cj7CX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81737a3f-3ebb-400c-b960-e95d7b4faff0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`/etc/logrotate.d` あたりを見ると、残す期間ありますね","ts":"1614654278.063400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vonX6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4766051-3a01-450a-95f0-37763f18b4a6","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"`/var/log/apache2` の一番古い `/var/log/apache2/access.log.52.gz` を確認したら1月だったから、 Debian/Ubuntu 系のデフォルトのままだとそのぐらいなのかも。(設定変更したかどうか覚えてない)","ts":"1614654210.062800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xkcW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ce72845-1548-4da8-909b-ed7143ca20e4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"アクセスがあったという事だから directory index 表示されてたって事だろうか。","ts":"1614652617.062500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wje"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7661351f-bffe-4668-a370-b5b9370bc576","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u0026gt; 市は、行政手続きなどの一環で、画像データを市民などからホームページを介して送ってもらっていたということですが\nようするに、ブログの画像アップローダーみたいなの使って上げてたってことかな?","ts":"1614618030.061900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eStB/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3a81169-58b4-4c27-84f0-5b99fea8e0a6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"結局はそういうことか","ts":"1614617855.061000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+n2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58f161f3-a09e-422c-be1b-72358c9b8c25","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちゃんとそういう運用できるところだったらアクセス権限の漏れとかポカミス少なさそう。","ts":"1614617614.060800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W9pJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5862717-f31c-4c0d-ad70-5ed1467355d9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そのようなシステムはないんだろう","ts":"1614617587.060300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DE9W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f50e43f-e607-4ca9-b604-63d8a6896337","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ログに対して特別なバックアップをとっていれば別","ts":"1614617575.060000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YVK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02933b44-4748-4d4f-832e-e75b577769c1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"数ヶ月も経つとログが残ってないことは多いと思うよ","ts":"1614617535.059400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bv="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d809ffd0-2b25-40d2-8226-89e0ad8ce8aa","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いやー、でもディスクの問題もあるし","ts":"1614